    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d703-a1">

                <pb facs="0688" n="1422" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1422"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 740.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McAdoo to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Navy Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-18"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that the
                    following instructions were cabled on the 7th instant to the commander in chief
                    of the United States naval force on the European station at Mersina, Syria:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The <hi rendition="#italic">Minneapolis</hi> ordered to Alexandretta,
                            Syria, Marash, Turkey, center of danger. Suggest the concentration of
                            vessels United States Navy, and taking missionaries and other Americans
                            on board, if necessary. Act promptly if in your judgment advisable to
                            land force. Keep Department fully informed. Acknowledge.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. McAdoo.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
